        "hp_back_app" to "Back to the app",
        "pa_1_text" to "The PlayStation needs to know which account the TV connects with. This is found out by signing in to the PlayStation account. It is done on a phone, only once, and takes about two minutes.\n\nOpen the camera on your phone, point it at the square on the left and tap the link that appears. A ReCaption page from this TV opens, so the phone must be on the same Wi-Fi. Then choose Continue here.",
