        "wp_web_h" to "Sign in using the browser",
        "wp_1" to "1. Tap the button. The Sony sign-in opens in a new tab.",
        "wp_login_btn" to "Sign in to PlayStation",
        "wp_2" to "2. Sign in with the 🔵 SECOND account. When the page asks about a “passkey”, choose Remind Me Later. In the end an almost empty page with the word “redirect” remains. Tap its address at the top and choose Copy. Then return in the browser to this ReCaption tab (it is not an app) and paste the address below. If Sony doesn’t ask for a password and shows “redirect” right away, the browser is already signed in to another account (e.g. the 🟢 gaming one) – open this page’s address in a private window and start again.",
